        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Pinball Wizard\", \"Tommy\", \"Overture\", \"Underture\", \"Sparks\"\n- People: The Who\n- Topics: single releases, studio albums, chart performance, instrumental tracks\n\nFacts:\n- In May 1969, The Who first released \"Tommy\" as their fourth studio album and as a double album.\n- In 1969, the original recording of \"Pinball Wizard\" was released as a single.\n- In 1969, \"Pinball Wizard\" reached No. 4 on the UK charts and No. 19 on the U.S. Billboard Hot 100.\n- \"Overture\" is one of three instrumental tracks released on \"Tommy\".\n- \"Overture\" includes some lyrics toward the end.\n- The other two instrumental tracks on \"Tommy\" are \"Underture\" and \"Sparks\".",
